<title>USA: Ticketmaster buys full interest in venture.</title>
<headline>Ticketmaster buys full interest in venture.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ticketmaster Group Inc said Wedesday it bought the outstanding 50 percent equity stake in its Ticketmaster-Northwest joint venture for $12.55 million in cash, giving it full ownership.</p>
<p>Ticketmaster-Northwest, which operates in the Seattle, Washington area and in Oregon, sells about 2.4 million tickets a year.</p>
